# Vouch Harbor — demo provider bootstrap (copy to .env.local and fill in)
# .env.local is gitignored. NEVER commit a live key.

# ── Generalist provider demo bootstrap ──────────────────────────────────────
# The VH-19 door reads these at boot and offers to connect in one click.
# Point VITE_VH_DEMO_BASE at any OpenAI-compatible endpoint — the dev server
# proxies /th-api → https://tokenharbor.ai (see vite.config.ts), or use your
# own key directly.
VITE_VH_DEMO_BASE=/th-api/v1
VITE_VH_DEMO_MODEL=deepseek-v4.1-flash:free
VITE_VH_DEMO_KEY=

# ── Exam / learning keys (19.3.0 surfaces, optional) ────────────────────────
# Exams can borrow the demo provider, or use dedicated keys via env / UI.
# VH_OPENAI_API_KEY=
# VH_OPENAI_BASE=
# VH_OPENAI_MODEL=
